Article 10 — Duration and Irrevocability

10.1 This license is perpetual. It applies to all current and future versions of the Software.

10.2 The Author may update this license for future versions, but such updates apply only to versions released after the update.

10.3 Once accepted, this license cannot be revoked by You.

10.4 The Author reserves the right to relicense the Software under a compatible copyleft license in the future, at their sole discretion.

